# {{DISPLAY_LABEL}} Wiki Query

Answer from this installed, immutable AD Wiki snapshot. All paths below are relative to the directory containing this `SKILL.md`; never resolve them from the user's current working directory.

## Navigate compiled knowledge

1. Read `references/artifact-manifest.json` to understand the snapshot and declared limits.
2. Read `references/repository/ad-wiki.yaml`, then `references/repository/{{BUNDLE_ROOT}}/index.md`.
3. Follow relevant directory indexes and Markdown links. Search only inside `references/repository/{{BUNDLE_ROOT}}` when search is available; scripts are never required.
4. Read complete relevant Concepts before answering. Index entries and search matches are navigation clues, not proof.
5. Read [Query Contract](references/query-contract.md) before answering.

Use a compiled hit directly without reading Raw. When one relevant Concept omits one narrow detail, resolve only its declared source through `references/repository/.ad-wiki/source-registry.json`, select the highest registered version for the exact canonical locator, and inspect one relevant document or section from that exact registered path. If command execution is available, the optional helper provides the same bounded, hash-verified fallback:

```bash
python3 <installed-skill-root>/scripts/query_registered_raw.py \
  --repo <installed-skill-root>/references/repository \
  --query <question> --concept <concept-id> \
  --max-sources 2 --max-chars 6000 --json
```

Never scan the Raw directory or unrelated registry records. When packaged evidence is insufficient or freshness-sensitive, consult only an exact external Primary Source declared by a relevant Concept when host capabilities permit, and label it as outside this snapshot.

